lator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On that middle, January to February, June to July and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025, November to December came in at 52% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 21140 had its driest year in 1963 at 46% of normal.</p>"}
